    "Practise with demo=true (a local practice market: nothing is published and no real money moves) and validate on network=testnet before using network=mainnet.",
    "Run the cappz-market CLI directly when MCP access is not needed; it prints JSON and requires --yes for every mainnet money movement.",
    "Keep the contribution disabled until a local administrator enables it, keep XRPL_SEED and CAPPZ_PASSWORD in the server environment rather than prompts, and limit agent parties with a scoped, expiring mandate granted on the web."
